8fc29ba5f19","title":"We believe in the cause because children are our future. They are our tomorrow and to support them and ensure a better future for them is our duty and we strive to make the world a better place with each tomorrow.","description":{"data":{"description":"<p>We strongly believe that as members of the human race, our allegiance lies in uplifting each other, extending a helping hand at every step of the way. We are committed to integrating social and humanitarian principles at the core of our business, thereby creating a better world by touching the lives of those that will make our future a better place.</p><p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate takes immense pride in being a part of the esteemed CR Hope Foundation. A charity, non-profit initiative launched in Zanzibar in 2016, CR Hope is a foundation that provides support in the advancement of education for, amateur sports and poverty relief for children of Zanzibar.</p>"}},"strapi_id":27,"strapi_component":"modules.content-and-stats","heading":"OUR ENDEAVOURS","stats":[]},{"id":"3eb36901-f4a7-5388-a349-f0cee376aece","strapi_id":3,"strapi_component":"modules.images-slider","images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ph_1_c7ea211751.jpg","id":"5a4651ed-fe6e-52c2-a053-bf3194d9a668"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ph_2_7184970cbe.jpg","id":"864e2110-1cac-5f20-b06f-0e13c7a34329"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ph_3_2059de2384.jpg","id":"22b83e0f-578b-540e-a7c1-1ec101e0a366"}]},{"id":"cd9a41b2-b26a-5e91-a659-1b6f42f24b56","cta":{"cta_label":"Make a Donation","custom_link":"https://crhopefoundation.org/","isExternal":false,"icon":"up-right-arrow-white","id":"9da5d74a-0c7e-56db-9706-6f3856aedbf9","strapi_id":508,"menu":null},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/cr_hope_foundation_f247f59140.jpg"},"design_title":{"data":{"design_title":""}},"img_align":"left","strapi_component":"modules.tile-block","strapi_id":72,"title":"We raise a helping hand.","description":{"data":{"description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We strongly believe that together we can do better! Since its very first days, CR HOPE Foundation has been relying on our community’s support, without which none of the things we have done would be possible.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A donation of even $1 could make a difference and contribute to building a better future for the children of Zanzibar.</span></p>"}},"video_url":null,"heading":"get involved","icon_stats":[],"bg_color":null,"image_fit":null,"style":null},{"id":"e984a6be-b318-593b-9701-7a90c77b1592","strapi_component":"components.video-block","video_url":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=loUkRJm_Pu4","video":null,"thumbnail":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/cr_hope_4092dd88c4.jpg"},"strapi_id":230}]}},"pageContext":{"page_id":"b7649711-5922-5ac2-a62f-db45fdace011"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1089302090","1722115342","2073252141","285207698","3472835299","3592264445","3783427077","4102000158","4272994477","4293686711","702895677","867548045"]}